  "notes": [
    "Original model geometry, skeleton translations and scales remain unchanged within Float32 precision. Public master and all public clips/registry entries were not modified.",
    "These are explicit low-ledge adaptations of Meshy lateral climbing. Missing donor environment geometry is not invented as source-ground parity. The same physical material points are measured against authored fixed surfaces.",
    "Holder grounding offset is -0.0023397356271734893. Reported full-support minima are model coordinates; actual world minima include that shared offset. Relative model/wall contact and collision tests share the same transform.",
    "Runtime geometry is fixed within a holder. Root owns locking initial Host origin and yaw. Existing audit fixes yaw within each case and does not prove moving-Host anchoring.",
    "439/619 first visual pass lacked the wall because an empty generic socket-probe list hid it. This was fixed by resolving the explicitly bound Doreumi mesh; root is recapturing a new bundle.",
    "440/620 v15 repair the normal-right donor final 33ms right-leg collapse only in the physical-foot reference. The original upper body, hips and total source duration remain intact. The repair is bound to the source file SHA and recorded in environmentSupport.referenceTailRepair.",
    "No new API requests or purchases. No automatic ambient promotion."
  ],
